<title>FRANCE: Deutsche Bank joins MATIF Ecu future market makers.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank joins MATIF Ecu future market makers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French futures and options exchange MATIF SA said on Thursday Deutsche Bank had been added to the exchange's list of market makers in its long-term Ecu bond future.</p>
<p>&quot;This undertaking reflects Deutsche Bank's strategy to be present in Paris in all financial areas, including the Ecu, as part of French preparations for monetary union,&quot; MATIF quoted Deutsche's Eugene Burghardt as saying in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
